Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.84,0:00:13.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hughes-san... I'm here again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:34.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For crying out loud,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.28,0:00:37.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,be more thorough when you rebuild these things, would you, Winry?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.96,0:00:46.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.42,0:00:48.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's still a good distance to go\Nbefore we reach Ishbal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.97,0:00:51.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do we do?\NAll we can do is walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.01,0:00:53.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Eh!? We can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.93,0:00:57.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I might be all right,\Nbut it's going to wear you out, Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.52,0:00:58.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then what would you rather do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.02,0:01:02.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There aren't any tracks into Ishbal,\Nall the usual roads have been closed down,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.48,0:01:05.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and we can't very well get the military to send us there anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.94,0:01:07.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You {\i1}are{\i0} right about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.36,0:01:08.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's just keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.82,0:01:10.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we just stand around here,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.82,0:01:13.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ishbal isn't very well\Ngoing to come to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.37,0:01:14.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.49,0:01:18.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Jeez, why is he always so haphazard?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.87,0:01:23.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man cannot obtain anything\Nwithout first sacrificing something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.58,0:01:28.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In order to obtain anything,\Nsomething of equal value is required.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.88,0:01:33.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is alchemy's\NLaw of Equivalent Exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.59,0:01:39.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the time, we believed that\Nto be the true way of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.12,0:03:26.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There, you see?\NWe somehow managed to make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.83,0:03:29.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Somehow made it?\NWe just arrived at some town, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.92,0:03:35.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In a town this size, we'll be able to\Nprocure a car and anything else we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.51,0:03:36.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.59,0:03:40.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're kids, after all!\NThere's no way we'll be able to get someone to sell us a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.97,0:03:43.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, it's all going to work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.43,0:03:46.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, why are you\Nalways like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.31,0:03:48.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Think ahead a little, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.56,0:03:50.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I {\i1}am{\i0} thinking ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.31,0:03:51.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You are not!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.94,0:03:54.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Such as what we're about to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.61,0:03:58.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.66,0:04:03.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you sure\Nit's the right thing to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.70,0:04:07.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand how you feel about wanting to stop Scar-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.21,0:04:12.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but the goal of our journey is to\Nget our original bodies back, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.84,0:04:13.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well then...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.75,0:04:15.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well then,\Nwhat would you have us do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.34,0:04:18.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.47,0:04:23.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But maybe we should do something about \Nthe homunculi before dealing with Scar-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.72,0:04:24.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.64,0:04:26.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you even realize what you're saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.06,0:04:30.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All I'm saying is that maybe \Nthere are other ways to go about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.90,0:04:32.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.69,0:04:35.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In any case, I'm saying that you have to think harder about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.19,0:04:38.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shut up!\N{\i1}You{\i0} think harder about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.70,0:04:43.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.91,0:04:46.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ha! That's what you get for talking too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.41,0:04:47.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're awful!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.58,0:04:48.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If that's how you want it,\NI'll show you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.96,0:04:56.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, {\i1}you're{\i0} the one\Nwho needs to cool his head!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.84,0:04:58.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now you've done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.05,0:05:03.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.35,0:05:05.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Jeez, what are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.56,0:05:08.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.02,0:05:11.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.27,0:05:13.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why, you little...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.37,0:05:28.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, why are you always like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.62,0:05:29.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you so stubborn?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.00,0:05:31.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm not stubborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.41,0:05:32.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.92,0:05:36.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, if you'd act\Nmore accommodating,\Nmaybe we could discuss this with Dad or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.29,0:05:37.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.30,0:05:39.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, I'll never ask for his help!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.51,0:05:41.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's you being stubborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.93,0:05:43.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sh-Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.26,0:05:46.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Suit yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.72,0:05:48.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.35,0:05:50.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.27,0:05:54.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen you in a while, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.81,0:05:56.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, Book...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.86,0:05:57.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Book-bull...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.02,0:05:59.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, Bookworm-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.78,0:06:02.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Scieszka.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.86,0:06:02.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.07,0:06:04.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, Winwin-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.78,0:06:07.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's Winry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.91,0:06:07.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.83,0:06:10.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.75,0:06:12.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes? What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.66,0:06:14.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, you go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.46,0:06:17.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.17,0:06:21.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The truth is, there's something I'd like to discuss with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.67,0:06:22.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.43,0:06:28.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've been investigating for a long time\Nabout why Lt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.30,0:06:31.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Colonel—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.30,0:06:33.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I mean, why Brigadier General Hughes had to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.60,0:06:37.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lt. Colonel—I mean,\NBrigadier General Hughes—
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.27,0:06:38.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Er...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.77,0:06:40.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't we just\Ncall him Hughes-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.40,0:06:43.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.28,0:06:44.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.70,0:06:46.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.41,0:06:48.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.49,0:06:53.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The more I look into it, the more strange things keep turning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.00,0:06:56.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know what\NI should do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.13,0:06:58.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why are you telling me this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.63,0:07:02.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't trust anyone in the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.34,0:07:04.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not even Colonel Mustang.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.55,0:07:08.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please! I can't take this anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.55,0:07:11.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If I don't tell someone, I'll... I'll...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.64,0:07:14.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! All right, okay?\NCalm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.48,0:07:17.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.15,0:07:22.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sheesh, what's his deal?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.07,0:07:25.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.24,0:07:27.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, pass the salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.83,0:07:35.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.34,0:07:46.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These are the materials that Hughes-san had me bring together and copy down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.84,0:07:51.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And these are the materials I used to\Nreference them, which I've collected on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.35,0:07:56.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh, you're not saying you \Nwant me to read {\i1}all{\i0} of this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.39,0:07:57.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.52,0:07:58.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's absolutely impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.81,0:08:00.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How many months do you think that would take?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.65,0:08:01.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.02,0:08:03.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, allow me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.69,0:08:07.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It started with the accident that collapsed the 5th Laboratory.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.36,0:08:13.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There aren't any records, so there's no way for me \Nto know what was happening in the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.74,0:08:17.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, that's where\NHughes-san's investigation began.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.25,0:08:19.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.96,0:08:22.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes? What did you find out?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.88,0:08:28.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right. Hughes-san was investigating the 5th Laboratory and the Ishbalan Rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.47,0:08:29.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ishbal?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.68,0:08:32.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is just my conjecture, but I think
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.68,0:08:36.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,that Hughes-san discovered an important secret that he wasn't supposed to know, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.23,0:08:39.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He was killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.98,0:08:44.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ah, okay! I get it! Don't cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.61,0:08:51.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, you dummy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.16,0:08:52.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.07,0:08:55.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you even realize what you're saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.29,0:08:57.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.12,0:09:00.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know at least that\N{\i1}she{\i0} is ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.97,0:09:10.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother?! Jeez, where were—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.51,0:09:13.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Martel-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.01,0:09:15.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Long time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.64,0:09:20.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As I was looking through this material,\NI kept running into a certain person's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.60,0:09:21.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What person?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.85,0:09:23.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Captain Juliet Douglas,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.90,0:09:27.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,the woman they say was the trigger for the Ishbalan Rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.94,0:09:29.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But something is strange about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.40,0:09:34.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She died in an accident two years before the Ishbalan Rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.70,0:09:37.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can I have you look at this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.33,0:09:41.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.50,0:09:45.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It was in Hughes-san's files.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.88,0:09:48.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He sent away to\Nher hometown for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.01,0:09:52.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The year she died is two years\Nbefore the Ishbalan Rebellion, all right,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.76,0:09:54.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but it's just some\Nkind of error, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.43,0:09:57.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Some mistake in the records, or someone with the same name or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.51,0:10:00.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There are no mistakes in the government records, or in the military records.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.27,0:10:02.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's more...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.64,0:10:03.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's more?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.81,0:10:06.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's still in the military.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.03,0:10:10.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.20,0:10:13.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.07,0:10:18.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,According to the grave record, she died two years before the Ishbalan Rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.08,0:10:22.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, according to the military materials,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.08,0:10:24.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,she fought in the war against Ishbal, without her name being cleared from the enlistment rolls,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.29,0:10:28.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and currently, she has been\Npromoted to the Führer's secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.75,0:10:30.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's strange, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.17,0:10:33.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Someone who's supposed to be dead\Nis the Führer's secretary?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.80,0:10:35.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's not all, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.59,0:10:36.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's more?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.22,0:10:41.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If she really is alive,\Nthen at the very least,\Nshe has to be in her fifties.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.89,0:10:45.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But right now, the Juliet-san that is serving as the Führer's secretary
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.44,0:10:49.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,has to be in her mid-thirties any way you look at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.73,0:10:52.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She died, but she's not dead! She doesn't age, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.74,0:10:55.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who in the world \Nis this woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.28,0:10:59.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,These are all things that I could not explain,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.16,0:11:01.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,but after I became desperate and thought about it all,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.74,0:11:03.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I arrived at a certain hypothesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.62,0:11:05.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A hypothesis?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.50,0:11:11.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If my hypothesis is right, then all of the inconsistencies are swept away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.76,0:11:16.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Juliet Douglas-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.60,0:11:22.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is an alien.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.48,0:11:26.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.02,0:11:27.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.02,0:11:29.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then what else could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.02,0:11:31.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I-I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.40,0:11:35.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if we continue\Nto investigate this,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.03,0:11:38.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,we'll find out who killed Hughes-san, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.45,0:11:41.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But how do we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.20,0:11:45.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I am a soldier for the time being, but I'm a records clerk,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.21,0:11:48.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and with Juliet-san\Nbeing with the Führer,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.92,0:11:51.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't very well\Nget too close to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.21,0:11:54.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't investigate\Nwhat she's up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.30,0:11:59.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case, what if we were to wiretap her line, to find out more about her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.76,0:12:00.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wiretap?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.80,0:12:03.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the thing that wives do\Nto get evidence on their husbands
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.97,0:12:05.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,when they're going\Nthrough a divorce, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.81,0:12:07.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I can do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.81,0:12:09.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.77,0:12:12.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Let's wiretap!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.36,0:12:17.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Martel-san,\Nwhat are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.70,0:12:19.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I followed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.99,0:12:22.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wanted you to tell me about your enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.41,0:12:23.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My enemies?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.04,0:12:26.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those guys who dress all in black.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.37,0:12:29.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do to them once you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.54,0:12:30.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.17,0:12:32.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take my revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.63,0:12:41.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about my uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.97,0:12:45.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When all you do is heavy labor,\Nyour arms do tend to thicken up, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.06,0:12:48.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should go on\Na diet or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.68,0:12:52.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As far as that matter goes, I'll make out the report.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.87,0:13:05.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.41,0:13:08.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.50,0:13:14.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Do you know those\Ntwo people from earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.25,0:13:15.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.63,0:13:17.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.55,0:13:20.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The telephone lines should all be concentrated in this facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.55,0:13:25.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But there are\Nso many locks on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.51,0:13:28.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,and there must be some\Nsecure alarm devices, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.56,0:13:30.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It won't be all that easy\Nto slip in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.77,0:13:32.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's open.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.81,0:13:35.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This much was easy, easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.86,0:13:37.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-Amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.65,0:13:39.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.41,0:13:45.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, where is her room?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.87,0:13:48.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The central hall, number 103.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.00,0:13:51.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,103...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.29,0:13:52.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.25,0:13:54.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right, we're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.75,0:13:57.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now we just have to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.80,0:14:03.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.26,0:14:05.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If you do this, then it won't mean anything for Greed-san, Roa-san and the others
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.68,0:14:07.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,to have protected you, Martel-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.97,0:14:09.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You know about me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.73,0:14:13.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm a Chimera.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.48,0:14:16.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't go on living as a regular person anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.23,0:14:20.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I've lost my friends, Greed-san,\Nand the only place\Nwhere I could have lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.28,0:14:23.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you can't take revenge\Nbecause of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.32,0:14:24.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It won't do any good\Nto try to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.86,0:14:28.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm half snake now,\Nso my vindictiveness runs deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.87,0:14:31.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You just can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.62,0:14:35.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She reminds me of Scar-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.38,0:14:39.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There isn't anything left for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.50,0:14:42.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And those guys are\Nyour enemies, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.72,0:14:44.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In that case,\NI'll take care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.26,0:14:49.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't plan on assisting you\Nin your revenge,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.39,0:14:50.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,nor do I intend\Nto let you take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.22,0:14:52.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.14,0:14:55.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because I'm sure that's what\NRoa-san and the others were thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.81,0:14:57.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.65,0:15:03.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.15,0:15:05.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's why I have to stop them—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.28,0:15:08.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}both Scar-san and Martel-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.58,0:15:14.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Al!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.25,0:15:18.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's no easy task finding him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.85,0:15:32.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Edward!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.43,0:15:34.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Edward!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.02,0:15:38.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't find Alphonse anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.52,0:15:39.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.15,0:15:41.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How should I know about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.15,0:15:44.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fighting again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.69,0:15:46.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.45,0:15:50.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He keeps pestering me about when Dad is coming home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.33,0:15:53.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That is a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.54,0:15:56.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wonder where\NAlphonse could have gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.91,0:16:00.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I just don't know\Nwhere he could be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.30,0:16:06.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why do I have to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.28,0:16:25.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.21,0:16:47.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, Führer's Office.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.97,0:16:51.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...communication coming in\Non a public line. Their code is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.84,0:16:53.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,zero, eigh... two.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.60,0:16:54.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please put it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.64,0:16:57.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here it comes! Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.44,0:17:00.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.06,0:17:02.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Envy,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.44,0:17:05.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,using regular phone lines is supposed to be forbidden except in cases of emergency.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.02,0:17:07.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't be so strict.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.73,0:17:10.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're the one who said to report in, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.70,0:17:12.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm almost there, in the north.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.62,0:17:14.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's so quiet here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.12,0:17:16.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If things stay this calm, then I might have to—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.45,0:17:18.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You will faithfully\Ncarry out your task.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.04,0:17:21.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.54,0:17:22.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Envy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.79,0:17:25.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Envy is one of those homunculi that Ed was talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.71,0:17:31.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm hanging up. It sounds like\NI've got one more job to take care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.56,0:17:42.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't we get\Nout of here now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.19,0:17:44.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.61,0:17:48.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um, about that\Nconversation just now...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.11,0:17:51.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What in the world\Nwere they talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.57,0:17:52.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.82,0:17:56.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But somehow,\Nit seemed like they were talking about something dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.03,0:18:01.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like it's going to take\Na lot more time to gather any evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.58,0:18:07.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even by trying wiretapping and such, it's not going to be all that easy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.59,0:18:09.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.43,0:18:21.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.02,0:18:25.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hurry!\NRight!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.07,0:18:30.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.69,0:18:32.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How should I know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.20,0:18:39.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Uh, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.37,0:18:40.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That girl! That girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.67,0:18:52.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The exit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.30,0:18:58.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Winry-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.20,0:19:15.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Their mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.32,0:19:20.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ed and Al's...\Nmother?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.79,0:19:25.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Winry-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.75,0:19:30.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So it {\i1}was{\i0} you, Winry-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.13,0:19:31.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing\Nin a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.63,0:19:38.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.39,0:19:40.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's an alien, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.14,0:19:42.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An alien?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.45,0:20:03.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.92,0:20:08.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.63,0:20:12.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're going to Ishbal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.67,0:20:15.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's stop Scar-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.39,0:20:28.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How did you know\NI would be there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.81,0:20:30.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You haven't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.90,0:20:36.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You always used to sulk down by the riverside\Nwhenever we got into\Na fight, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.69,0:20:37.70,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.83,0:20:44.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.83,0:20:47.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Not much we can do\Nexcept walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.21,0:20:53.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Want to hop on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.50,0:20:54.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Martel-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.00,0:20:56.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Al, you know her?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.01,0:20:58.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.76,0:21:02.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, we'll take you up on that\Nif you'd be so kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.72,0:21:04.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,H-Hold on, Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.81,0:21:05.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Where's the harm?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.02,0:21:08.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've got to help each other out when we're in trouble, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.15,0:21:18.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to\Nmake sure I stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.70,0:21:24.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right then, we're off!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.33,0:21:25.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.50,0:21:34.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.79,0:21:36.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mm-mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.34,0:21:39.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Brother, do you remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.05,0:21:42.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The first time we ever\Ngot into a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.84,0:21:46.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, you mean the time\Nyou tossed me around, Al.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.22,0:21:48.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That was the first time I ever went down to the riverside.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.97,0:21:50.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.27,0:21:51.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.48,0:21:55.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,When we were at Sensei's place,\Nyou'd disappear right after we'd fight, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.86,0:21:58.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, I had to work for both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.15,0:22:01.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We even fought over which one of us\Nwas going to marry Winry, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.11,0:22:03.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We argued about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.86,0:22:04.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We did!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.29,0:23:39.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fullmetal Alchemist{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.92,0:23:42.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Episode 39: "Eastern Civil War"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.05,0:23:47.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The place that Scar has chosen\Nis a city that we will never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.39,0:23:50.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The name of that city is Liore.
